 urday November 7th\, 5:00 - 7:00 PM Holiday Party Saturday December 5th\, 
 5:00 - 7:00 PM Gallery Nights Thursday November 12th and December 10th\, 5
 :00 - 7:00 PM DeBlois Gallery is delighted to present its annual Fine Arts
  and Artisans Marketplace from Nov. 7 &#8211\; Dec. 23\, 2026\, bringing t
 ogether original artwork and handcrafted gifts for the holiday season. Spa
 nning November and December\, the marketplace will offer visitors a two-mo
 nth period to shop for distinctive gifts while supporting local artists an
 d artisans. The diverse selection includes ornaments\, jewelry\, wearable 
 art\, prints\, paintings\, pottery and holiday cards. Fine art and crafts 
 share the gallery space\, offering an inviting mix of pieces to display\, 
 wear\, use and give. For shoppers seeking gifts with a personal connection
 \, the marketplace offers choices ranging from jewelry to suit your indivi
 dual style\, to pottery and original artwork that add an artistic touch to
  your home. There are also hand-crafted holiday ornaments and cards ideal 
 for observing seasonal traditions. DeBlois gift certificates will also be 
 available\, the perfect present for recipients to choose a work that speak
 s to them. As one of Rhode Island’s few cooperative galleries\, DeBlois 
 offers a distinctive setting shaped by the artists who love the space\, br
 inging a variety of creative perspectives into one shared space where visi
 tors can discover different styles and media in a welcoming atmosphere. Th
 e holiday marketplace reflects that spirit\, celebrating individual crafts
 manship and the collective creativity of the gallery community. Participat
 ing artists are available for interviews upon request. Deblois Gallery is 
 located at 134 Aquidneck Avenue in Middletown and is open Wednesday throug
 h Sunday\, from 1:00 - 5:00 PM. All are welcome\, and ample free parking i
 s available. Visit www.debloisgallery.com or follow the gallery on Instagr
 am and Facebook for updates on participating artists and holiday events. M
 edia contact: Michael Day | dr.mday@gmail.com Gallery: (401) 847-9977 | ww
 w.debloisgallery.com Instagram / Facebook\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhod
 eisland.com/event/fine-arts-and-artisans-holiday-marketplace/112555/
LOCATION:DeBlois Gallery\, 134 Aquidneck Avenue\, Middletown\, RI 02842
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/fine-arts-and-artisans-holiday-
 marketplace/112555/
END:VEVENT
