DESCRIPTION:Cars &amp\; Coffee When: Select Sundays from 8:00 AM to 10:00 
 AM at Second Beach\, 315 Sachuest Point Road\, Middletown May 10 October 1
 1 October 18 October 25 November 8 November 15 Cars &amp\; Coffee\, hosted
  by the Audrain Automobile Museum\, has grown exponentially since the star
 t - now eight years ago\, only 52 cars appeared at the first event! The Ca
 rs &amp\; Coffee family has expanded\, now consistently seeing 350-400 car
 s on the field and more than 1\,000 at the Motor Week event. We feel that 
 Cars &amp\; Coffee is now the backbone Audrain Automobile Museum and the l
 ocal car community as well. Cheers to another season! Below are a couple r
 eminders for the 2026 Season: For Audrain Members\, registration will open
  the Monday before each of the Cars &amp\; Coffee events and public regist
 ration will open on the Wednesday before each of the Cars &amp\; Coffee ev
 ents. In order to register for one of the Cars &amp\; Coffee events\, you 
 must be subscribed to our email list. You cannot register for any of the C
 ars &amp\; Coffee events through the Audrain website or over the phone. On
 ly Vehicles are required to register for the event. Guests of drivers\, an
 d spectators do not need to register. *All events are subject to change. A
 ll events are rain or shine unless noted.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhod
 eisland.com/event/cars-%26-coffee-%e2%80%94-sachuest-beach-(second-beach)/
 109992/
